window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a463-9881a7dc70be2510.json"]={sha256:"9881a7dc70be2510eb8b963bea8ffd9c71f14a8c3b1a7cbf3bde1d0a7be604be",value:{"id":"a463","title":"中子散射儀","titleEn":"Neutron-scattering instruments","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從中子的德布羅意波長與毫電子伏特能量出發，說明反應爐與散裂源如何經緩速器產生熱與冷中子，再把超鏡導管、斬波器飛行時間、三軸譜儀的單色器與分析器、³He 偵測器效率、釩標準歸一化與背景計數統計整合成一份可驗收的中子散射儀工程紀錄。","summaryEn":"Starting from the de Broglie wavelength and millielectronvolt energy of neutrons, the course shows how reactors and spallation sources produce thermal and cold neutrons through moderators, then integrates supermirror guides, chopper time of flight, triple-axis monochromators and analysers, ³He detector efficiency, vanadium normalisation and background counting statistics into an acceptance-ready neutron-scattering instrument record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-accelerators-detectors","subcategoryTitle":"加速器、光束線與粒子偵測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Accelerators, beamlines and particle detectors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-accelerators-detectors","learningTags":["optics","optics-accelerators-detectors","detector"],"architectureFamily":"detector","architectureNodes":[["中子源與緩速器","Neutron source and moderator"],["超鏡中子導管","Supermirror neutron guide"],["斬波器或單色器","Choppers or monochromator"],["樣品與樣品環境","Sample and sample environment"],["分析器與偵測器","Analyser and detectors"],["歸一化與資料還原","Normalisation and data reduction"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"detector","labels":["中子源與緩速器","超鏡中子導管","斬波器或單色器","樣品與樣品環境","分析器與偵測器"],"labelsEn":["Neutron source and moderator","Supermirror neutron guide","Choppers or monochromator","Sample and sample environment","Analyser and detectors"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"冷中子飛行時間能譜練習：入射波長 λi = 4 Å，vi = 3956/4 = 989 m/s，Ei = 81.81/16 ≈ 5.11 meV。樣品到偵測器 L2 = 3.0 m，彈性中子飛行時間 t2 = 3.0/989 ≈ 3.033 ms。若中子在樣品激發 ħω = 1.0 meV 的激發，Ef ≈ 4.11 meV，λf = √(81.81/4.11) ≈ 4.46 Å，vf ≈ 887 m/s，t2 ≈ 3.382 ms，比彈性晚約 0.349 ms。彈性能量解析度 ΔE/E ≈ 2Δt/t2，取等效時間不確定 Δt = 15 µs，ΔE/E ≈ 0.99%，ΔE ≈ 51 µeV。若源頻率 60 Hz、源到偵測器總路徑 23 m，4 Å 中子總飛行 23.26 ms 已超過 16.67 ms 框架，帶寬斬波器必須把波長範圍限制在約 3956/(60×23) ≈ 2.87 Å 以內。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際儀器規格。","textEn":"Cold-neutron time-of-flight exercise: incident wavelength λi = 4 Å gives vi = 3956/4 = 989 m/s and Ei = 81.81/16 ≈ 5.11 meV. With sample-to-detector distance L2 = 3.0 m the elastic flight time is t2 = 3.0/989 ≈ 3.033 ms. If the neutron creates a ħω = 1.0 meV excitation in the sample, Ef ≈ 4.11 meV, λf = √(81.81/4.11) ≈ 4.46 Å, vf ≈ 887 m/s and t2 ≈ 3.382 ms, arriving about 0.349 ms after the elastic line. The elastic energy resolution is ΔE/E ≈ 2Δt/t2; taking an effective timing uncertainty Δt = 15 µs gives ΔE/E ≈ 0.99% and ΔE ≈ 51 µeV. At a 60 Hz source with a 23 m total source-to-detector path, a 4 Å neutron takes 23.26 ms, longer than the 16.67 ms frame, so the bandwidth choppers must restrict the band to about 3956/(60×23) ≈ 2.87 Å. Values are teaching assumptions, not any real instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a463-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「中子波長、速度與能量換算」與「散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion\" and \"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a463-v12-01","title":"中子波長、速度與能量換算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「熱中子與冷中子能譜」如何決定中子散射儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Thermal and cold neutron spectrum” determines the key performance of “Neutron-scattering instruments”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"中子不帶電，能穿透數公分金屬到達樣品內部，並經由短程核力與原子核散射；它還帶有磁矩，能直接感受未成對電子的磁結構。散射長度隨同位素不規則變化，氫與氘的差異讓軟物質可以做對比變換。熱中子的波長約 1 到 2 Å，與原子間距相當，能量約數十 meV，與聲子和磁激發相當，所以同一束中子能同時量結構與動力學，這是中子散射儀存在的物理理由。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「熱中子與冷中子能譜」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Neutrons are uncharged, penetrate centimetres of metal to reach the bulk of a sample, and scatter from nuclei through the short-range nuclear force; they also carry a magnetic moment that senses unpaired-electron magnetism directly. Scattering lengths vary irregularly between isotopes, and the hydrogen–deuterium difference allows contrast variation in soft matter. Thermal neutrons have wavelengths of about 1 to 2 Å, comparable to interatomic spacings, and energies of tens of meV, comparable to phonons and magnetic excitations, so one beam probes structure and dynamics together, which is the physical reason neutron-scattering instruments exist. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Thermal and cold neutron spectrum”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s]，E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s] and E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]. λ = 1.798 Å corresponds to v ≈ 2200 m/s and E ≈ 25.3 meV (room-temperature thermal neutrons); a 4 Å cold neutron has v = 989 m/s and E ≈ 5.11 meV; λ = 1 Å gives E ≈ 81.8 meV.","failure":"常見誤解：「原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「熱中子與冷中子能譜」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Thermal and cold neutron spectrum”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-01-k1","title":"中子波長、速度與能量換算","titleEn":"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion","text":"中子不帶電，能穿透數公分金屬到達樣品內部，並經由短程核力與原子核散射；它還帶有磁矩，能直接感受未成對電子的磁結構。散射長度隨同位素不規則變化，氫與氘的差異讓軟物質可以做對比變換。","textEn":"Neutrons are uncharged, penetrate centimetres of metal to reach the bulk of a sample, and scatter from nuclei through the short-range nuclear force; they also carry a magnetic moment that senses unpaired-electron magnetism directly. Scattering lengths vary irregularly between isotopes, and the hydrogen–deuterium difference allows contrast variation in soft matter.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「中子波長、速度與能量換算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion\" is correct?","options":["原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。","中子不帶電，能穿透數公分金屬到達樣品內部，並經由短程核力與原子核散射；它還帶有磁矩，能直接感受未成對電子的磁結構。","只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。"],"optionsEn":["Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly.","Neutrons are uncharged, penetrate centimetres of metal to reach the bulk of a sample, and scatter from nuclei through the short-range nuclear force.","With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q."],"answer":1,"explanation":"中子不帶電，能穿透數公分金屬到達樣品內部，並經由短程核力與原子核散射；它還帶有磁矩，能直接感受未成對電子的磁結構。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Neutrons are uncharged, penetrate centimetres of metal to reach the bulk of a sample, and scatter from nuclei through the short-range nuclear force; they also carry a magnetic moment that senses unpaired-electron magnetism directly. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a463-v12-02","title":"中子波長、速度與能量換算：定量估算","titleEn":"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「熱中子與冷中子能譜」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Thermal and cold neutron spectrum” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s]，E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]。λ = 1.798 Å 對應 v ≈ 2200 m/s、E ≈ 25.3 meV（室溫熱中子）；λ = 4 Å 的冷中子 v = 989 m/s、E ≈ 5.11 meV；λ = 1 Å 則 E ≈ 81.8 meV。波長加倍，速度減半而能量降為四分之一。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s] and E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]. λ = 1.798 Å corresponds to v ≈ 2200 m/s and E ≈ 25.3 meV (room-temperature thermal neutrons); a 4 Å cold neutron has v = 989 m/s and E ≈ 5.11 meV; λ = 1 Å gives E ≈ 81.8 meV. Doubling the wavelength halves the speed and quarters the energy. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以已知晶格常數的標準粉末（例如矽）量測布拉格峰位置反推入射波長，並與飛行時間量得的速度換算結果比較；兩者差異應在 0.1% 以內，否則要檢查飛行距離量測或單色器角度零點。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure Bragg-peak positions of a standard powder with known lattice constant, such as silicon, to infer the incident wavelength, and compare it with the value converted from a time-of-flight velocity measurement; they should agree within 0.1%, otherwise check the flight-path survey or the monochromator angle zero.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s]，E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]。λ = 1.798 Å 對應 v ≈ 2200 m/s、E ≈ 25.3 meV（室溫熱中子）；λ = 4 Å 的冷中子 v = 989 m/s、E ≈ 5.11 meV；λ = 1 Å 則 E ≈ 81.8 meV。波長加倍，速度減半而能量降為四分之一。","textEn":"λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s] and E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]. λ = 1.798 Å corresponds to v ≈ 2200 m/s and E ≈ 25.3 meV (room-temperature thermal neutrons); a 4 Å cold neutron has v = 989 m/s and E ≈ 5.11 meV; λ = 1 Å gives E ≈ 81.8 meV. Doubling the wavelength halves the speed and quarters the energy.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「中子波長、速度與能量換算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion\", which statement holds?","options":["m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。","中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。","λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s]，E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]。"],"optionsEn":["A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle.","A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength.","λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s] and E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]. λ = 1.798 Å corresponds to v ≈ 2200 m/s and E ≈ 25.3 meV (room-temperature thermal neutrons)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s]，E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"λ[Å] = 3956/v[m/s] and E[meV] = 81.81/λ²[Å]. λ = 1.798 Å corresponds to v ≈ 2200 m/s and E ≈ 25.3 meV (room-temperature thermal neutrons); a 4 Å cold neutron has v = 989 m/s and E ≈ 5.11 meV; λ = 1 Å gives E ≈ 81.8 meV. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a463-v12-03","title":"中子波長、速度與能量換算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「熱中子與冷中子能譜」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Thermal and cold neutron spectrum” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以已知晶格常數的標準粉末（例如矽）量測布拉格峰位置反推入射波長，並與飛行時間量得的速度換算結果比較；兩者差異應在 0.1% 以內，否則要檢查飛行距離量測或單色器角度零點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure Bragg-peak positions of a standard powder with known lattice constant, such as silicon, to infer the incident wavelength, and compare it with the value converted from a time-of-flight velocity measurement; they should agree within 0.1%, otherwise check the flight-path survey or the monochromator angle zero. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把 X 光的經驗直接套用而忽略中子對輕元素與同位素的敏感度，會錯估樣品的散射與吸收；例如含天然硼或鎘的樣品座會吸收大部分冷中子，訊號幾乎消失。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Carrying over X-ray habits while ignoring neutron sensitivity to light elements and isotopes misjudges sample scattering and absorption; for example a sample holder containing natural boron or cadmium absorbs most cold neutrons and the signal nearly vanishes.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以已知晶格常數的標準粉末（例如矽）量測布拉格峰位置反推入射波長，並與飛行時間量得的速度換算結果比較；兩者差異應在 0.1% 以內，否則要檢查飛行距離量測或單色器角度零點。","textEn":"Measure Bragg-peak positions of a standard powder with known lattice constant, such as silicon, to infer the incident wavelength, and compare it with the value converted from a time-of-flight velocity measurement; they should agree within 0.1%, otherwise check the flight-path survey or the monochromator angle zero.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「中子波長、速度與能量換算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion\"?","options":["以已知晶格常數的標準粉末（例如矽）量測布拉格峰位置反推入射波長，並與飛行時間量得的速度換算結果比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。"],"optionsEn":["Measure Bragg-peak positions of a standard powder with known lattice constant, such as silicon, to infer the incident wavelength, and compare it with the value converted from a time-of-flight velocity measurement.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以已知晶格常數的標準粉末（例如矽）量測布拉格峰位置反推入射波長，並與飛行時間量得的速度換算結果比較；兩者差異應在 0.1% 以內，否則要檢查飛行距離量測或單色器角度零點。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure Bragg-peak positions of a standard powder with known lattice constant, such as silicon, to infer the incident wavelength, and compare it with the value converted from a time-of-flight velocity measurement; they should agree within 0.1%, otherwise check the flight-path survey or the monochromator angle zero. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a463-v12-04","title":"中子波長、速度與能量換算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「熱中子與冷中子能譜」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Thermal and cold neutron spectrum” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把 X 光的經驗直接套用而忽略中子對輕元素與同位素的敏感度，會錯估樣品的散射與吸收；例如含天然硼或鎘的樣品座會吸收大部分冷中子，訊號幾乎消失。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Carrying over X-ray habits while ignoring neutron sensitivity to light elements and isotopes misjudges sample scattering and absorption; for example a sample holder containing natural boron or cadmium absorbs most cold neutrons and the signal nearly vanishes. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：熱中子的波長約 1 到 2 Å，與原子間距相當，能量約數十 meV，與聲子和磁激發相當，所以同一束中子能同時量結構與動力學，這是中子散射儀存在的物理理由。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Thermal neutrons have wavelengths of about 1 to 2 Å, comparable to interatomic spacings, and energies of tens of meV, comparable to phonons and magnetic excitations, so one beam probes structure and dynamics together, which is the physical reason neutron-scattering instruments exist.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把 X 光的經驗直接套用而忽略中子對輕元素與同位素的敏感度，會錯估樣品的散射與吸收；例如含天然硼或鎘的樣品座會吸收大部分冷中子，訊號幾乎消失。","textEn":"Carrying over X-ray habits while ignoring neutron sensitivity to light elements and isotopes misjudges sample scattering and absorption; for example a sample holder containing natural boron or cadmium absorbs most cold neutrons and the signal nearly vanishes.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「中子波長、速度與能量換算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Neutron wavelength, velocity and energy conversion\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","把 X 光的經驗直接套用而忽略中子對輕元素與同位素的敏感度，會錯估樣品的散射與吸收；例如含天然硼或鎘的樣品座會吸收大部分冷中子，訊號幾乎消失。","只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Carrying over X-ray habits while ignoring neutron sensitivity to light elements and isotopes misjudges sample scattering and absorption.","With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把 X 光的經驗直接套用而忽略中子對輕元素與同位素的敏感度，會錯估樣品的散射與吸收；例如含天然硼或鎘的樣品座會吸收大部分冷中子，訊號幾乎消失。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Carrying over X-ray habits while ignoring neutron sensitivity to light elements and isotopes misjudges sample scattering and absorption; for example a sample holder containing natural boron or cadmium absorbs most cold neutrons and the signal nearly vanishes. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a463-v12-05","title":"散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「散射向量 Q 與能量轉移 ħω」如何決定中子散射儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Scattering vector Q and energy transfer ħω” determines the key performance of “Neutron-scattering instruments”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"中子散射實驗量的是散射函數 S(Q, ω)：入射波向量 ki 與散射波向量 kf 的差就是動量轉移 Q，兩者動能之差就是樣品吸收或放出的能量 ħω。彈性散射只看 Q，給出結構；非彈性散射同時看 Q 與 ħω，給出聲子或磁子色散。因為 ki、kf 與散射角受運動學三角形約束，給定入射能量時並不是每一組 (Q, ω) 都能到達，儀器設計必須先確認目標激發落在可達區域內。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「散射向量 Q 與能量轉移 ħω」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Neutron scattering measures the scattering function S(Q, ω): the difference between incident and scattered wavevectors ki and kf is the momentum transfer Q, and the difference in kinetic energy is the energy ħω absorbed or released by the sample. Elastic scattering looks at Q only and yields structure; inelastic scattering looks at Q and ħω together and yields phonon or magnon dispersions. Because ki, kf and the scattering angle are tied by the kinematic triangle, not every (Q, ω) pair is reachable for a given incident energy, so instrument design must first confirm that the target excitation lies in the accessible region. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Scattering vector Q and energy transfer ħω”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：彈性散射 Q = 4π·sinθ/λ（2θ 為散射角），能量與波向量 E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For elastic scattering Q = 4π·sinθ/λ with 2θ the scattering angle, and energy relates to wavevector as E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²].","failure":"常見誤解：「只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「散射向量 Q 與能量轉移 ħω」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Scattering vector Q and energy transfer ħω”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-05-k1","title":"散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移","titleEn":"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer","text":"中子散射實驗量的是散射函數 S(Q, ω)：入射波向量 ki 與散射波向量 kf 的差就是動量轉移 Q，兩者動能之差就是樣品吸收或放出的能量 ħω。彈性散射只看 Q，給出結構；非彈性散射同時看 Q 與 ħω，給出聲子或磁子色散。","textEn":"Neutron scattering measures the scattering function S(Q, ω): the difference between incident and scattered wavevectors ki and kf is the momentum transfer Q, and the difference in kinetic energy is the energy ħω absorbed or released by the sample. Elastic scattering looks at Q only and yields structure; inelastic scattering looks at Q and ħω together and yields phonon or magnon dispersions.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer\" is correct?","options":["只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。","緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。","中子散射實驗量的是散射函數 S(Q, ω)：入射波向量 ki 與散射波向量 kf 的差就是動量轉移 Q，兩者動能之差就是樣品吸收或放出的能量 ħω。"],"optionsEn":["With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q.","A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons.","Neutron scattering measures the scattering function S(Q, ω): the difference between incident and scattered wavevectors ki and kf is the momentum transfer Q, and the difference in kinetic energy is the energy ħω absorbed or released by the sample."],"answer":2,"explanation":"中子散射實驗量的是散射函數 S(Q, ω)：入射波向量 ki 與散射波向量 kf 的差就是動量轉移 Q，兩者動能之差就是樣品吸收或放出的能量 ħω。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Neutron scattering measures the scattering function S(Q, ω): the difference between incident and scattered wavevectors ki and kf is the momentum transfer Q, and the difference in kinetic energy is the energy ħω absorbed or released by the sample. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a463-v12-06","title":"散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移：定量估算","titleEn":"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「散射向量 Q 與能量轉移 ħω」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Scattering vector Q and energy transfer ħω” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：彈性散射 Q = 4π·sinθ/λ（2θ 為散射角），能量與波向量 E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²]。λ = 2.359 Å、2θ = 90° 時 Q = 4π·sin45°/2.359 ≈ 3.77 Å⁻¹，對應晶面間距 d = 2π/Q ≈ 1.67 Å；ħω = Ei − Ef。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For elastic scattering Q = 4π·sinθ/λ with 2θ the scattering angle, and energy relates to wavevector as E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²]. For λ = 2.359 Å and 2θ = 90°, Q = 4π·sin45°/2.359 ≈ 3.77 Å⁻¹, corresponding to a lattice spacing d = 2π/Q ≈ 1.67 Å; the energy transfer is ħω = Ei − Ef. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在實驗規劃軟體中畫出給定 Ei 與偵測器角度範圍的 (Q, ω) 可達區域，把文獻或計算的色散曲線疊上去確認覆蓋；試車時以單晶標準樣品的已知布拉格反射校正晶體方位矩陣，再量一條已知聲子分支，比較峰位與文獻值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Plot the accessible (Q, ω) region for the chosen Ei and detector-angle range in planning software and overlay literature or calculated dispersions to confirm coverage; at commissioning calibrate the crystal orientation matrix on known Bragg reflections of a single-crystal standard, then measure a known phonon branch and compare peak positions with literature.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"彈性散射 Q = 4π·sinθ/λ（2θ 為散射角），能量與波向量 E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²]。λ = 2.359 Å、2θ = 90° 時 Q = 4π·sin45°/2.359 ≈ 3.77 Å⁻¹，對應晶面間距 d = 2π/Q ≈ 1.67 Å；ħω = Ei − Ef。","textEn":"For elastic scattering Q = 4π·sinθ/λ with 2θ the scattering angle, and energy relates to wavevector as E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²]. For λ = 2.359 Å and 2θ = 90°, Q = 4π·sin45°/2.359 ≈ 3.77 Å⁻¹, corresponding to a lattice spacing d = 2π/Q ≈ 1.67 Å; the energy transfer is ħω = Ei − Ef.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer\", which statement holds?","options":["彈性散射 Q = 4π·sinθ/λ（2θ 為散射角），能量與波向量 E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²]。","飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。","三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。"],"optionsEn":["For elastic scattering Q = 4π·sinθ/λ with 2θ the scattering angle, and energy relates to wavevector as E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²].","A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time.","Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction."],"answer":0,"explanation":"彈性散射 Q = 4π·sinθ/λ（2θ 為散射角），能量與波向量 E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For elastic scattering Q = 4π·sinθ/λ with 2θ the scattering angle, and energy relates to wavevector as E[meV] = 2.072·k²[Å⁻²]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a463-v12-07","title":"散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「散射向量 Q 與能量轉移 ħω」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Scattering vector Q and energy transfer ħω” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在實驗規劃軟體中畫出給定 Ei 與偵測器角度範圍的 (Q, ω) 可達區域，把文獻或計算的色散曲線疊上去確認覆蓋；試車時以單晶標準樣品的已知布拉格反射校正晶體方位矩陣，再量一條已知聲子分支，比較峰位與文獻值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Plot the accessible (Q, ω) region for the chosen Ei and detector-angle range in planning software and overlay literature or calculated dispersions to confirm coverage; at commissioning calibrate the crystal orientation matrix on known Bragg reflections of a single-crystal standard, then measure a known phonon branch and compare peak positions with literature. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：入射能量選得太低時，想量的高能激發落在運動學禁區，量測時間全部浪費在沒有訊號的區域；方位矩陣若沒校正好，掃描路徑偏離高對稱方向，色散看起來被拉平或分裂。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: With too low an incident energy the high-energy excitation of interest falls in the kinematically forbidden region and the beamtime is spent where no signal can exist; with a poorly calibrated orientation matrix the scan path drifts off the high-symmetry direction and the dispersion appears flattened or split.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在實驗規劃軟體中畫出給定 Ei 與偵測器角度範圍的 (Q, ω) 可達區域，把文獻或計算的色散曲線疊上去確認覆蓋；試車時以單晶標準樣品的已知布拉格反射校正晶體方位矩陣，再量一條已知聲子分支，比較峰位與文獻值。","textEn":"Plot the accessible (Q, ω) region for the chosen Ei and detector-angle range in planning software and overlay literature or calculated dispersions to confirm coverage; at commissioning calibrate the crystal orientation matrix on known Bragg reflections of a single-crystal standard, then measure a known phonon branch and compare peak positions with literature.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在實驗規劃軟體中畫出給定 Ei 與偵測器角度範圍的 (Q, ω) 可達區域，把文獻或計算的色散曲線疊上去確認覆蓋。","只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Plot the accessible (Q, ω) region for the chosen Ei and detector-angle range in planning software and overlay literature or calculated dispersions to confirm coverage.","With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在實驗規劃軟體中畫出給定 Ei 與偵測器角度範圍的 (Q, ω) 可達區域，把文獻或計算的色散曲線疊上去確認覆蓋；試車時以單晶標準樣品的已知布拉格反射校正晶體方位矩陣，再量一條已知聲子分支，比較峰位與文獻值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Plot the accessible (Q, ω) region for the chosen Ei and detector-angle range in planning software and overlay literature or calculated dispersions to confirm coverage; at commissioning calibrate the crystal orientation matrix on known Bragg reflections of a single-crystal standard, then measure a known phonon branch and compare peak positions with literature. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a463-v12-08","title":"散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「散射向量 Q 與能量轉移 ħω」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Scattering vector Q and energy transfer ħω” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"入射能量選得太低時，想量的高能激發落在運動學禁區，量測時間全部浪費在沒有訊號的區域；方位矩陣若沒校正好，掃描路徑偏離高對稱方向，色散看起來被拉平或分裂。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"With too low an incident energy the high-energy excitation of interest falls in the kinematically forbidden region and the beamtime is spent where no signal can exist; with a poorly calibrated orientation matrix the scan path drifts off the high-symmetry direction and the dispersion appears flattened or split. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：因為 ki、kf 與散射角受運動學三角形約束，給定入射能量時並不是每一組 (Q, ω) 都能到達，儀器設計必須先確認目標激發落在可達區域內。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because ki, kf and the scattering angle are tied by the kinematic triangle, not every (Q, ω) pair is reachable for a given incident energy, so instrument design must first confirm that the target excitation lies in the accessible region.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"入射能量選得太低時，想量的高能激發落在運動學禁區，量測時間全部浪費在沒有訊號的區域；方位矩陣若沒校正好，掃描路徑偏離高對稱方向，色散看起來被拉平或分裂。","textEn":"With too low an incident energy the high-energy excitation of interest falls in the kinematically forbidden region and the beamtime is spent where no signal can exist; with a poorly calibrated orientation matrix the scan path drifts off the high-symmetry direction and the dispersion appears flattened or split.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「散射向量、動量守恆與能量轉移」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scattering vector, momentum conservation and energy transfer\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。","入射能量選得太低時，想量的高能激發落在運動學禁區，量測時間全部浪費在沒有訊號的區域；方位矩陣若沒校正好，掃描路徑偏離高對稱方向，色散看起來被拉平或分裂。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons.","With too low an incident energy the high-energy excitation of interest falls in the kinematically forbidden region and the beamtime is spent where no signal can exist."],"answer":2,"explanation":"入射能量選得太低時，想量的高能激發落在運動學禁區，量測時間全部浪費在沒有訊號的區域；方位矩陣若沒校正好，掃描路徑偏離高對稱方向，色散看起來被拉平或分裂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With too low an incident energy the high-energy excitation of interest falls in the kinematically forbidden region and the beamtime is spent where no signal can exist; with a poorly calibrated orientation matrix the scan path drifts off the high-symmetry direction and the dispersion appears flattened or split. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a463-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「中子源與緩速器」與「中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Neutron sources and moderators\" and \"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a463-v12-09","title":"中子源與緩速器：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Neutron sources and moderators: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「反應爐爐心、散裂靶與緩速器」如何決定中子散射儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Reactor core, spallation target and moderator” determines the key performance of “Neutron-scattering instruments”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"研究用反應爐以鈾分裂產生連續的百萬電子伏特快中子，散裂源則以高能質子撞擊重金屬靶產生脈衝快中子。兩者都必須經過緩速器，讓中子與輕原子核多次彈性碰撞降到熱平衡：室溫輕水或重水產生熱中子，約 20 K 的液態氫冷源把頻譜推向長波長。緩速器的材料、溫度、體積與耦合方式決定了中子頻譜峰值與脈衝寬度，對散裂源而言是通量與時間解析度的取捨。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「反應爐爐心、散裂靶與緩速器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Research reactors produce a continuous flux of MeV fast neutrons from uranium fission, while spallation sources produce pulsed fast neutrons by striking a heavy-metal target with high-energy protons. Both need a moderator, in which repeated elastic collisions with light nuclei bring the neutrons to thermal equilibrium: room-temperature light or heavy water yields thermal neutrons, and a liquid-hydrogen cold source near 20 K shifts the spectrum to long wavelengths. Moderator material, temperature, volume and coupling set the spectral peak and the pulse width, which for a spallation source is a trade between flux and time resolution. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Reactor core, spallation target and moderator”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：從 E0 緩速到 E 所需的平均碰撞次數 n = ln(E0/E)/ξ，ξ 為每次碰撞的平均對數能量減損。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The mean number of collisions to slow from E0 to E is n = ln(E0/E)/ξ, with ξ the mean logarithmic energy decrement per collision.","failure":"常見誤解：「緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「反應爐爐心、散裂靶與緩速器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Reactor core, spallation target and moderator”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-09-k1","title":"中子源與緩速器","titleEn":"Neutron sources and moderators","text":"研究用反應爐以鈾分裂產生連續的百萬電子伏特快中子，散裂源則以高能質子撞擊重金屬靶產生脈衝快中子。兩者都必須經過緩速器，讓中子與輕原子核多次彈性碰撞降到熱平衡：室溫輕水或重水產生熱中子，約 20 K 的液態氫冷源把頻譜推向長波長。","textEn":"Research reactors produce a continuous flux of MeV fast neutrons from uranium fission, while spallation sources produce pulsed fast neutrons by striking a heavy-metal target with high-energy protons. Both need a moderator, in which repeated elastic collisions with light nuclei bring the neutrons to thermal equilibrium: room-temperature light or heavy water yields thermal neutrons, and a liquid-hydrogen cold source near 20 K shifts the spectrum to long wavelengths.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「中子源與緩速器」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Neutron sources and moderators\" is correct?","options":["研究用反應爐以鈾分裂產生連續的百萬電子伏特快中子，散裂源則以高能質子撞擊重金屬靶產生脈衝快中子。","緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。","m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。"],"optionsEn":["Research reactors produce a continuous flux of MeV fast neutrons from uranium fission, while spallation sources produce pulsed fast neutrons by striking a heavy-metal target with high-energy protons.","A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons.","A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"研究用反應爐以鈾分裂產生連續的百萬電子伏特快中子，散裂源則以高能質子撞擊重金屬靶產生脈衝快中子。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Research reactors produce a continuous flux of MeV fast neutrons from uranium fission, while spallation sources produce pulsed fast neutrons by striking a heavy-metal target with high-energy protons. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a463-v12-10","title":"中子源與緩速器：定量估算","titleEn":"Neutron sources and moderators: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「反應爐爐心、散裂靶與緩速器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Reactor core, spallation target and moderator” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：從 E0 緩速到 E 所需的平均碰撞次數 n = ln(E0/E)/ξ，ξ 為每次碰撞的平均對數能量減損。2 MeV 降到 25.3 meV：氫 ξ = 1，n ≈ 18；氘 ξ = 0.725，n ≈ 25；碳 ξ = 0.158，n ≈ 115，所以含氫材料最短距離內完成緩速，但氫的吸收也較大。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The mean number of collisions to slow from E0 to E is n = ln(E0/E)/ξ, with ξ the mean logarithmic energy decrement per collision. From 2 MeV to 25.3 meV: hydrogen with ξ = 1 needs n ≈ 18, deuterium with ξ = 0.725 needs n ≈ 25 and carbon with ξ = 0.158 needs n ≈ 115, so hydrogenous moderators slow neutrons in the shortest distance, though hydrogen also absorbs more. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在光束口以飛行時間法量測中子波長譜，與緩速器中子輸運模擬比較峰值波長與長波長尾端；對脈衝源再以已知單晶的布拉格峰形狀反推脈衝時間結構，並追蹤冷源溫度與正氫比例變化時頻譜的改變。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the wavelength spectrum at the beam port by time of flight and compare peak wavelength and long-wavelength tail with neutron-transport simulation of the moderator; for a pulsed source infer the emission-time structure from Bragg-peak shapes of a known crystal, and track spectral changes as cold-source temperature and ortho-hydrogen fraction vary.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"從 E0 緩速到 E 所需的平均碰撞次數 n = ln(E0/E)/ξ，ξ 為每次碰撞的平均對數能量減損。2 MeV 降到 25.3 meV：氫 ξ = 1，n ≈ 18；氘 ξ = 0.725，n ≈ 25；碳 ξ = 0.158，n ≈ 115，所以含氫材料最短距離內完成緩速，但氫的吸收也較大。","textEn":"The mean number of collisions to slow from E0 to E is n = ln(E0/E)/ξ, with ξ the mean logarithmic energy decrement per collision. From 2 MeV to 25.3 meV: hydrogen with ξ = 1 needs n ≈ 18, deuterium with ξ = 0.725 needs n ≈ 25 and carbon with ξ = 0.158 needs n ≈ 115, so hydrogenous moderators slow neutrons in the shortest distance, though hydrogen also absorbs more.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「中子源與緩速器」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Neutron sources and moderators\", which statement holds?","options":["中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。","從 E0 緩速到 E 所需的平均碰撞次數 n = ln(E0/E)/ξ，ξ 為每次碰撞的平均對數能量減損。","只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。"],"optionsEn":["A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength.","The mean number of collisions to slow from E0 to E is n = ln(E0/E)/ξ, with ξ the mean logarithmic energy decrement per collision.","With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"從 E0 緩速到 E 所需的平均碰撞次數 n = ln(E0/E)/ξ，ξ 為每次碰撞的平均對數能量減損。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The mean number of collisions to slow from E0 to E is n = ln(E0/E)/ξ, with ξ the mean logarithmic energy decrement per collision. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a463-v12-11","title":"中子源與緩速器：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Neutron sources and moderators: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「反應爐爐心、散裂靶與緩速器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Reactor core, spallation target and moderator” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在光束口以飛行時間法量測中子波長譜，與緩速器中子輸運模擬比較峰值波長與長波長尾端；對脈衝源再以已知單晶的布拉格峰形狀反推脈衝時間結構，並追蹤冷源溫度與正氫比例變化時頻譜的改變。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the wavelength spectrum at the beam port by time of flight and compare peak wavelength and long-wavelength tail with neutron-transport simulation of the moderator; for a pulsed source infer the emission-time structure from Bragg-peak shapes of a known crystal, and track spectral changes as cold-source temperature and ortho-hydrogen fraction vary. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：冷源液態氫的正氫比例或溫度偏離設計時，冷中子通量下降且頻譜偏移，所有使用長波長的儀器同時看到計數率下降；若只看反應爐功率而不監測冷源狀態，會誤以為是儀器本身故障。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: When the ortho-hydrogen fraction or temperature of the liquid-hydrogen cold source drifts from design, cold-neutron flux falls and the spectrum shifts, so every long-wavelength instrument sees lower count rates together; watching only reactor power without monitoring the cold source leads to blaming the instruments.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在光束口以飛行時間法量測中子波長譜，與緩速器中子輸運模擬比較峰值波長與長波長尾端；對脈衝源再以已知單晶的布拉格峰形狀反推脈衝時間結構，並追蹤冷源溫度與正氫比例變化時頻譜的改變。","textEn":"Measure the wavelength spectrum at the beam port by time of flight and compare peak wavelength and long-wavelength tail with neutron-transport simulation of the moderator; for a pulsed source infer the emission-time structure from Bragg-peak shapes of a known crystal, and track spectral changes as cold-source temperature and ortho-hydrogen fraction vary.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「中子源與緩速器」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Neutron sources and moderators\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。","在光束口以飛行時間法量測中子波長譜，與緩速器中子輸運模擬比較峰值波長與長波長尾端。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly.","Measure the wavelength spectrum at the beam port by time of flight and compare peak wavelength and long-wavelength tail with neutron-transport simulation of the moderator."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在光束口以飛行時間法量測中子波長譜，與緩速器中子輸運模擬比較峰值波長與長波長尾端；對脈衝源再以已知單晶的布拉格峰形狀反推脈衝時間結構，並追蹤冷源溫度與正氫比例變化時頻譜的改變。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the wavelength spectrum at the beam port by time of flight and compare peak wavelength and long-wavelength tail with neutron-transport simulation of the moderator; for a pulsed source infer the emission-time structure from Bragg-peak shapes of a known crystal, and track spectral changes as cold-source temperature and ortho-hydrogen fraction vary. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a463-v12-12","title":"中子源與緩速器：失效診斷","titleEn":"Neutron sources and moderators: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「反應爐爐心、散裂靶與緩速器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Reactor core, spallation target and moderator” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"冷源液態氫的正氫比例或溫度偏離設計時，冷中子通量下降且頻譜偏移，所有使用長波長的儀器同時看到計數率下降；若只看反應爐功率而不監測冷源狀態，會誤以為是儀器本身故障。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"When the ortho-hydrogen fraction or temperature of the liquid-hydrogen cold source drifts from design, cold-neutron flux falls and the spectrum shifts, so every long-wavelength instrument sees lower count rates together; watching only reactor power without monitoring the cold source leads to blaming the instruments. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：緩速器的材料、溫度、體積與耦合方式決定了中子頻譜峰值與脈衝寬度，對散裂源而言是通量與時間解析度的取捨。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Moderator material, temperature, volume and coupling set the spectral peak and the pulse width, which for a spallation source is a trade between flux and time resolution.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"冷源液態氫的正氫比例或溫度偏離設計時，冷中子通量下降且頻譜偏移，所有使用長波長的儀器同時看到計數率下降；若只看反應爐功率而不監測冷源狀態，會誤以為是儀器本身故障。","textEn":"When the ortho-hydrogen fraction or temperature of the liquid-hydrogen cold source drifts from design, cold-neutron flux falls and the spectrum shifts, so every long-wavelength instrument sees lower count rates together; watching only reactor power without monitoring the cold source leads to blaming the instruments.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「中子源與緩速器」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Neutron sources and moderators\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["冷源液態氫的正氫比例或溫度偏離設計時，冷中子通量下降且頻譜偏移，所有使用長波長的儀器同時看到計數率下降。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。"],"optionsEn":["When the ortho-hydrogen fraction or temperature of the liquid-hydrogen cold source drifts from design, cold-neutron flux falls and the spectrum shifts, so every long-wavelength instrument sees lower count rates together.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"冷源液態氫的正氫比例或溫度偏離設計時，冷中子通量下降且頻譜偏移，所有使用長波長的儀器同時看到計數率下降；若只看反應爐功率而不監測冷源狀態，會誤以為是儀器本身故障。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"When the ortho-hydrogen fraction or temperature of the liquid-hydrogen cold source drifts from design, cold-neutron flux falls and the spectrum shifts, so every long-wavelength instrument sees lower count rates together; watching only reactor power without monitoring the cold source leads to blaming the instruments. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a463-v12-13","title":"中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「超鏡中子導管」如何決定中子散射儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Supermirror neutron guide” determines the key performance of “Neutron-scattering instruments”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"中子在大多數材料中的折射率略小於 1，以小角度入射鎳表面時會全反射，因此鍍鎳的玻璃或金屬矩形管能像光纖一樣把中子傳送到數十公尺外，讓儀器遠離爐心背景。超鏡在鎳層之上疊加數百到上千層厚度漸變的 Ni/Ti 多層膜，以布拉格反射把臨界角延伸到鎳的 m 倍。導管越長、m 值越高，能傳輸的發散角越大，但每次反射的損耗會隨反彈次數累積。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「超鏡中子導管」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Neutrons see a refractive index slightly below one in most materials and are totally reflected from nickel at small grazing angles, so nickel-coated glass or metal rectangular guides transport them tens of metres like an optical fibre, moving instruments away from core background. Supermirrors stack hundreds to thousands of graded Ni/Ti multilayers on top of nickel, using Bragg reflection to extend the critical angle to m times that of nickel. Longer guides and higher m transport more divergence, but per-reflection loss accumulates with the number of bounces. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Supermirror neutron guide”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：天然鎳的臨界角約 0.1°/Å，超鏡 θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Natural nickel has a critical angle of about 0.1° per Å, and a supermirror gives θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å].","failure":"常見誤解：「m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「超鏡中子導管」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Supermirror neutron guide”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-13-k1","title":"中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值","titleEn":"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value","text":"中子在大多數材料中的折射率略小於 1，以小角度入射鎳表面時會全反射，因此鍍鎳的玻璃或金屬矩形管能像光纖一樣把中子傳送到數十公尺外，讓儀器遠離爐心背景。超鏡在鎳層之上疊加數百到上千層厚度漸變的 Ni/Ti 多層膜，以布拉格反射把臨界角延伸到鎳的 m 倍。","textEn":"Neutrons see a refractive index slightly below one in most materials and are totally reflected from nickel at small grazing angles, so nickel-coated glass or metal rectangular guides transport them tens of metres like an optical fibre, moving instruments away from core background. Supermirrors stack hundreds to thousands of graded Ni/Ti multilayers on top of nickel, using Bragg reflection to extend the critical angle to m times that of nickel.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value\" is correct?","options":["m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。","中子在大多數材料中的折射率略小於 1，以小角度入射鎳表面時會全反射，因此鍍鎳的玻璃或金屬矩形管能像光纖一樣把中子傳送到數十公尺外，讓儀器遠離爐心背景。","飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。"],"optionsEn":["A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle.","Neutrons see a refractive index slightly below one in most materials and are totally reflected from nickel at small grazing angles, so nickel-coated glass or metal rectangular guides transport them tens of metres like an optical fibre, moving instruments away from core background.","A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"中子在大多數材料中的折射率略小於 1，以小角度入射鎳表面時會全反射，因此鍍鎳的玻璃或金屬矩形管能像光纖一樣把中子傳送到數十公尺外，讓儀器遠離爐心背景。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Neutrons see a refractive index slightly below one in most materials and are totally reflected from nickel at small grazing angles, so nickel-coated glass or metal rectangular guides transport them tens of metres like an optical fibre, moving instruments away from core background. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a463-v12-14","title":"中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值：定量估算","titleEn":"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「超鏡中子導管」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Supermirror neutron guide” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：天然鎳的臨界角約 0.1°/Å，超鏡 θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]。m = 3、λ = 4 Å 時 θc ≈ 1.2°。長 50 m、寬 50 mm 的導管，平均角度 0.6° 的中子反彈次數 N ≈ L·θ/w ≈ 10.5；每次反射率 0.95 時傳輸 ≈ 0.95^10.5 ≈ 0.58，降到 0.90 則只剩約 0.33。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Natural nickel has a critical angle of about 0.1° per Å, and a supermirror gives θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]. For m = 3 and λ = 4 Å, θc ≈ 1.2°. In a 50 m long, 50 mm wide guide a neutron at a mean angle of 0.6° bounces N ≈ L·θ/w ≈ 10.5 times; at 0.95 reflectivity per bounce transmission is ≈ 0.95^10.5 ≈ 0.58, dropping to about 0.33 at 0.90. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：每段導管出廠前以中子反射率儀量測 R(Q) 曲線，確認 m 值邊緣的反射率；安裝時以雷射追蹤儀把各段的對齊與接縫控制在數十微米與數十微弧度內；完成後在導管末端以飛行時間量測波長相依的通量與發散，與光線追跡模擬比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before delivery measure the R(Q) curve of each guide section on a neutron reflectometer to confirm reflectivity at the m-value edge; at installation align sections and joints to tens of micrometres and tens of microradians with a laser tracker; afterwards measure wavelength-dependent flux and divergence at the guide exit by time of flight and compare with ray-tracing simulation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"天然鎳的臨界角約 0.1°/Å，超鏡 θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]。m = 3、λ = 4 Å 時 θc ≈ 1.2°。長 50 m、寬 50 mm 的導管，平均角度 0.6° 的中子反彈次數 N ≈ L·θ/w ≈ 10.5；每次反射率 0.95 時傳輸 ≈ 0.95^10.5 ≈ 0.58，降到 0.90 則只剩約 0.33。","textEn":"Natural nickel has a critical angle of about 0.1° per Å, and a supermirror gives θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]. For m = 3 and λ = 4 Å, θc ≈ 1.2°. In a 50 m long, 50 mm wide guide a neutron at a mean angle of 0.6° bounces N ≈ L·θ/w ≈ 10.5 times; at 0.95 reflectivity per bounce transmission is ≈ 0.95^10.5 ≈ 0.58, dropping to about 0.33 at 0.90.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value\", which statement holds?","options":["三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。","原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。","天然鎳的臨界角約 0.1°/Å，超鏡 θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]。"],"optionsEn":["Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction.","Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly.","Natural nickel has a critical angle of about 0.1° per Å, and a supermirror gives θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]."],"answer":2,"explanation":"天然鎳的臨界角約 0.1°/Å，超鏡 θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Natural nickel has a critical angle of about 0.1° per Å, and a supermirror gives θc ≈ m×0.1°×λ[Å]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a463-v12-15","title":"中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「超鏡中子導管」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Supermirror neutron guide” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"每段導管出廠前以中子反射率儀量測 R(Q) 曲線，確認 m 值邊緣的反射率；安裝時以雷射追蹤儀把各段的對齊與接縫控制在數十微米與數十微弧度內；完成後在導管末端以飛行時間量測波長相依的通量與發散，與光線追跡模擬比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before delivery measure the R(Q) curve of each guide section on a neutron reflectometer to confirm reflectivity at the m-value edge; at installation align sections and joints to tens of micrometres and tens of microradians with a laser tracker; afterwards measure wavelength-dependent flux and divergence at the guide exit by time of flight and compare with ray-tracing simulation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：導管段之間的錯位或玻璃基板因長期輻照與真空失效而破裂，會在特定波長造成通量缺口，下游所有儀器同時受影響；只在單一波長檢查通量時，這種缺口很容易被漏掉。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Misalignment between guide sections, or glass substrates cracking after long irradiation or vacuum failure, punches wavelength-specific holes in the flux that hit every downstream instrument; checking flux at a single wavelength easily misses such gaps.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每段導管出廠前以中子反射率儀量測 R(Q) 曲線，確認 m 值邊緣的反射率；安裝時以雷射追蹤儀把各段的對齊與接縫控制在數十微米與數十微弧度內；完成後在導管末端以飛行時間量測波長相依的通量與發散，與光線追跡模擬比較。","textEn":"Before delivery measure the R(Q) curve of each guide section on a neutron reflectometer to confirm reflectivity at the m-value edge; at installation align sections and joints to tens of micrometres and tens of microradians with a laser tracker; afterwards measure wavelength-dependent flux and divergence at the guide exit by time of flight and compare with ray-tracing simulation.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value\"?","options":["每段導管出廠前以中子反射率儀量測 R(Q) 曲線，確認 m 值邊緣的反射率。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。"],"optionsEn":["Before delivery measure the R(Q) curve of each guide section on a neutron reflectometer to confirm reflectivity at the m-value edge.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每段導管出廠前以中子反射率儀量測 R(Q) 曲線，確認 m 值邊緣的反射率；安裝時以雷射追蹤儀把各段的對齊與接縫控制在數十微米與數十微弧度內；完成後在導管末端以飛行時間量測波長相依的通量與發散，與光線追跡模擬比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before delivery measure the R(Q) curve of each guide section on a neutron reflectometer to confirm reflectivity at the m-value edge; at installation align sections and joints to tens of micrometres and tens of microradians with a laser tracker; afterwards measure wavelength-dependent flux and divergence at the guide exit by time of flight and compare with ray-tracing simulation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a463-v12-16","title":"中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值：失效診斷","titleEn":"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「超鏡中子導管」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Supermirror neutron guide” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"導管段之間的錯位或玻璃基板因長期輻照與真空失效而破裂，會在特定波長造成通量缺口，下游所有儀器同時受影響；只在單一波長檢查通量時，這種缺口很容易被漏掉。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Misalignment between guide sections, or glass substrates cracking after long irradiation or vacuum failure, punches wavelength-specific holes in the flux that hit every downstream instrument; checking flux at a single wavelength easily misses such gaps. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：導管越長、m 值越高，能傳輸的發散角越大，但每次反射的損耗會隨反彈次數累積。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Longer guides and higher m transport more divergence, but per-reflection loss accumulates with the number of bounces.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"導管段之間的錯位或玻璃基板因長期輻照與真空失效而破裂，會在特定波長造成通量缺口，下游所有儀器同時受影響；只在單一波長檢查通量時，這種缺口很容易被漏掉。","textEn":"Misalignment between guide sections, or glass substrates cracking after long irradiation or vacuum failure, punches wavelength-specific holes in the flux that hit every downstream instrument; checking flux at a single wavelength easily misses such gaps.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「中子導管、臨界角與超鏡 m 值」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Neutron guides, critical angle and the supermirror m-value\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","導管段之間的錯位或玻璃基板因長期輻照與真空失效而破裂，會在特定波長造成通量缺口，下游所有儀器同時受影響；只在單一波長檢查通量時，這種缺口很容易被漏掉。","飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Misalignment between guide sections, or glass substrates cracking after long irradiation or vacuum failure, punches wavelength-specific holes in the flux that hit every downstream instrument.","A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"導管段之間的錯位或玻璃基板因長期輻照與真空失效而破裂，會在特定波長造成通量缺口，下游所有儀器同時受影響；只在單一波長檢查通量時，這種缺口很容易被漏掉。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Misalignment between guide sections, or glass substrates cracking after long irradiation or vacuum failure, punches wavelength-specific holes in the flux that hit every downstream instrument; checking flux at a single wavelength easily misses such gaps. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a463-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度」與「中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution\" and \"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a463-v12-17","title":"斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「盤式斬波器與飛行路徑」如何決定中子散射儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Disk choppers and flight path” determines the key performance of “Neutron-scattering instruments”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"飛行時間法以中子到達偵測器的時間決定速度，再換算波長與能量。散裂源本身是脈衝，反應爐則需以高速旋轉的盤式或費米斬波器把連續束切成短脈衝。波長解析度由脈衝時間寬度相對於總飛行時間的比例與飛行路徑不確定度決定；而相鄰脈衝的慢中子不能追上下一個脈衝的快中子，否則發生框架重疊，因此還需要帶寬斬波器限制每個脈衝的波長範圍。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「盤式斬波器與飛行路徑」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Time of flight fixes a neutron's speed from its arrival time at the detector and converts it to wavelength and energy. A spallation source is pulsed by nature, while a reactor needs fast-spinning disk or Fermi choppers to cut the continuous beam into short pulses. Wavelength resolution is set by pulse width relative to total flight time and by path-length uncertainty; slow neutrons of one pulse must not overlap fast neutrons of the next, or frame overlap occurs, so bandwidth choppers limit the wavelength band of each pulse. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Disk choppers and flight path”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：飛行時間 t = L·λ/3956。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Flight time is t = L·λ/3956; for L = 20 m and λ = 4 Å, t ≈ 20.2 ms.","failure":"常見誤解：「飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「盤式斬波器與飛行路徑」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Disk choppers and flight path”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-17-k1","title":"斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度","titleEn":"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution","text":"飛行時間法以中子到達偵測器的時間決定速度，再換算波長與能量。散裂源本身是脈衝，反應爐則需以高速旋轉的盤式或費米斬波器把連續束切成短脈衝。","textEn":"Time of flight fixes a neutron's speed from its arrival time at the detector and converts it to wavelength and energy. A spallation source is pulsed by nature, while a reactor needs fast-spinning disk or Fermi choppers to cut the continuous beam into short pulses.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution\" is correct?","options":["飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。","中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。","飛行時間法以中子到達偵測器的時間決定速度，再換算波長與能量。"],"optionsEn":["A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time.","A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength.","Time of flight fixes a neutron's speed from its arrival time at the detector and converts it to wavelength and energy."],"answer":2,"explanation":"飛行時間法以中子到達偵測器的時間決定速度，再換算波長與能量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Time of flight fixes a neutron's speed from its arrival time at the detector and converts it to wavelength and energy. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a463-v12-18","title":"斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度：定量估算","titleEn":"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「盤式斬波器與飛行路徑」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Disk choppers and flight path” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：飛行時間 t = L·λ/3956。L = 20 m、λ = 4 Å 時 t ≈ 20.2 ms。60 Hz 源每框架 16.67 ms，可用帶寬 Δλ = 3956×T/L ≈ 3.30 Å。緩速器脈衝寬 100 µs 與路徑不確定 2 cm 時，Δλ/λ ≈ √[(0.1/20.2)² + (0.02/20)²] ≈ 0.50%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Flight time is t = L·λ/3956; for L = 20 m and λ = 4 Å, t ≈ 20.2 ms. A 60 Hz source gives 16.67 ms per frame and a usable bandwidth Δλ = 3956×T/L ≈ 3.30 Å. With a 100 µs moderator pulse and a 2 cm path uncertainty, Δλ/λ ≈ √[(0.1/20.2)² + (0.02/20)²] ≈ 0.50%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以中子監測器在斬波器前後量測時間譜，確認各斬波器的相位與開口時間符合時序設計；在樣品位置放置已知單晶或粉末標準，量測布拉格峰的時間寬度並與解析度模型比較；刻意縮短帶寬斬波器開口，檢查長時間尾端是否有來自前一框架的慢中子。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure time spectra with neutron monitors before and after the choppers to confirm phases and opening times against the timing design; place a known single-crystal or powder standard at the sample and compare Bragg-peak time widths with the resolution model; deliberately narrow the bandwidth-chopper opening and check the long-time tail for slow neutrons from the previous frame.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"飛行時間 t = L·λ/3956。L = 20 m、λ = 4 Å 時 t ≈ 20.2 ms。60 Hz 源每框架 16.67 ms，可用帶寬 Δλ = 3956×T/L ≈ 3.30 Å。緩速器脈衝寬 100 µs 與路徑不確定 2 cm 時，Δλ/λ ≈ √[(0.1/20.2)² + (0.02/20)²] ≈ 0.50%。","textEn":"Flight time is t = L·λ/3956; for L = 20 m and λ = 4 Å, t ≈ 20.2 ms. A 60 Hz source gives 16.67 ms per frame and a usable bandwidth Δλ = 3956×T/L ≈ 3.30 Å. With a 100 µs moderator pulse and a 2 cm path uncertainty, Δλ/λ ≈ √[(0.1/20.2)² + (0.02/20)²] ≈ 0.50%.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution\", which statement holds?","options":["飛行時間 t = L·λ/3956。","只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。","只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。"],"optionsEn":["Flight time is t = L·λ/3956; for L = 20 m and λ = 4 Å, t ≈ 20.2 ms.","With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time.","With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q."],"answer":0,"explanation":"飛行時間 t = L·λ/3956。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Flight time is t = L·λ/3956; for L = 20 m and λ = 4 Å, t ≈ 20.2 ms. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a463-v12-19","title":"斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「盤式斬波器與飛行路徑」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Disk choppers and flight path” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以中子監測器在斬波器前後量測時間譜，確認各斬波器的相位與開口時間符合時序設計；在樣品位置放置已知單晶或粉末標準，量測布拉格峰的時間寬度並與解析度模型比較；刻意縮短帶寬斬波器開口，檢查長時間尾端是否有來自前一框架的慢中子。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure time spectra with neutron monitors before and after the choppers to confirm phases and opening times against the timing design; place a known single-crystal or powder standard at the sample and compare Bragg-peak time widths with the resolution model; deliberately narrow the bandwidth-chopper opening and check the long-time tail for slow neutrons from the previous frame. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：斬波器相位隨轉速漂移或控制器重新開機後未重新鎖相，入射能量偏移而使用者沒有察覺，整組非彈性數據的能量刻度錯誤；框架重疊則讓慢中子出現在錯誤的時間通道，形成假峰。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If chopper phase drifts with speed or is not re-locked after a controller restart, the incident energy shifts unnoticed and a whole inelastic data set carries the wrong energy scale; frame overlap places slow neutrons in the wrong time channels and creates spurious peaks.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以中子監測器在斬波器前後量測時間譜，確認各斬波器的相位與開口時間符合時序設計；在樣品位置放置已知單晶或粉末標準，量測布拉格峰的時間寬度並與解析度模型比較；刻意縮短帶寬斬波器開口，檢查長時間尾端是否有來自前一框架的慢中子。","textEn":"Measure time spectra with neutron monitors before and after the choppers to confirm phases and opening times against the timing design; place a known single-crystal or powder standard at the sample and compare Bragg-peak time widths with the resolution model; deliberately narrow the bandwidth-chopper opening and check the long-time tail for slow neutrons from the previous frame.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以中子監測器在斬波器前後量測時間譜，確認各斬波器的相位與開口時間符合時序設計。","緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Measure time spectra with neutron monitors before and after the choppers to confirm phases and opening times against the timing design.","A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以中子監測器在斬波器前後量測時間譜，確認各斬波器的相位與開口時間符合時序設計；在樣品位置放置已知單晶或粉末標準，量測布拉格峰的時間寬度並與解析度模型比較；刻意縮短帶寬斬波器開口，檢查長時間尾端是否有來自前一框架的慢中子。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure time spectra with neutron monitors before and after the choppers to confirm phases and opening times against the timing design; place a known single-crystal or powder standard at the sample and compare Bragg-peak time widths with the resolution model; deliberately narrow the bandwidth-chopper opening and check the long-time tail for slow neutrons from the previous frame. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a463-v12-20","title":"斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「盤式斬波器與飛行路徑」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Disk choppers and flight path” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"斬波器相位隨轉速漂移或控制器重新開機後未重新鎖相，入射能量偏移而使用者沒有察覺，整組非彈性數據的能量刻度錯誤；框架重疊則讓慢中子出現在錯誤的時間通道，形成假峰。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If chopper phase drifts with speed or is not re-locked after a controller restart, the incident energy shifts unnoticed and a whole inelastic data set carries the wrong energy scale; frame overlap places slow neutrons in the wrong time channels and creates spurious peaks. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：波長解析度由脈衝時間寬度相對於總飛行時間的比例與飛行路徑不確定度決定；而相鄰脈衝的慢中子不能追上下一個脈衝的快中子，否則發生框架重疊，因此還需要帶寬斬波器限制每個脈衝的波長範圍。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Wavelength resolution is set by pulse width relative to total flight time and by path-length uncertainty; slow neutrons of one pulse must not overlap fast neutrons of the next, or frame overlap occurs, so bandwidth choppers limit the wavelength band of each pulse.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"斬波器相位隨轉速漂移或控制器重新開機後未重新鎖相，入射能量偏移而使用者沒有察覺，整組非彈性數據的能量刻度錯誤；框架重疊則讓慢中子出現在錯誤的時間通道，形成假峰。","textEn":"If chopper phase drifts with speed or is not re-locked after a controller restart, the incident energy shifts unnoticed and a whole inelastic data set carries the wrong energy scale; frame overlap places slow neutrons in the wrong time channels and creates spurious peaks.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「斬波器、飛行時間與波長解析度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Choppers, time of flight and wavelength resolution\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。","斬波器相位隨轉速漂移或控制器重新開機後未重新鎖相，入射能量偏移而使用者沒有察覺，整組非彈性數據的能量刻度錯誤；框架重疊則讓慢中子出現在錯誤的時間通道，形成假峰。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength.","If chopper phase drifts with speed or is not re-locked after a controller restart, the incident energy shifts unnoticed and a whole inelastic data set carries the wrong energy scale."],"answer":2,"explanation":"斬波器相位隨轉速漂移或控制器重新開機後未重新鎖相，入射能量偏移而使用者沒有察覺，整組非彈性數據的能量刻度錯誤；框架重疊則讓慢中子出現在錯誤的時間通道，形成假峰。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If chopper phase drifts with speed or is not re-locked after a controller restart, the incident energy shifts unnoticed and a whole inelastic data set carries the wrong energy scale; frame overlap places slow neutrons in the wrong time channels and creates spurious peaks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a463-v12-21","title":"中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「³He 正比管與釩標準」如何決定中子散射儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “³He proportional tubes and vanadium standard” determines the key performance of “Neutron-scattering instruments”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"中子本身不游離，必須先被核反應轉成帶電粒子：³He(n,p)³H 反應釋放 764 keV，正比管收集質子與氚的游離電荷，伽瑪射線產生的訊號小很多，容易以脈高鑑別排除。³He 吸收截面與波長成正比，長波長效率高；但 ³He 供應短缺促使 ¹⁰B 塗層氣體偵測器與 ⁶Li 閃爍體等替代方案發展。各偵測器管的效率不同，必須以幾乎純非同調散射的釩樣品做歸一化，讓不同角度的強度可以比較。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「³He 正比管與釩標準」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Neutrons do not ionise directly and must first be converted into charged particles by a nuclear reaction: ³He(n,p)³H releases 764 keV, a proportional tube collects the ionisation of the proton and triton, and gamma rays give much smaller signals that pulse-height discrimination rejects. The ³He absorption cross-section is proportional to wavelength, so long wavelengths are detected efficiently; the ³He supply shortage has driven alternatives such as ¹⁰B-lined gas detectors and ⁶Li scintillators. Tubes differ in efficiency, so they are normalised against vanadium, an almost purely incoherent scatterer, to make intensities at different angles comparable. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “³He proportional tubes and vanadium standard”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：偵測效率 η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x)，吸收截面與波長成正比。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Detection efficiency is η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x), with the absorption cross-section proportional to wavelength. ³He at 10 bar and 293 K has n = P/(kT) ≈ 2.47×10²⁶ m⁻³; with σ(1.798 Å) = 5333 b and a mean path x ≈ 20 mm, η ≈ 93%; at λ = 1 Å, σ ≈ 2966 b and η ≈ 77%; at λ = 4 Å, η ≈ 99.7%.","failure":"常見誤解：「中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「³He 正比管與釩標準」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “³He proportional tubes and vanadium standard”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-21-k1","title":"中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化","titleEn":"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation","text":"中子本身不游離，必須先被核反應轉成帶電粒子：³He(n,p)³H 反應釋放 764 keV，正比管收集質子與氚的游離電荷，伽瑪射線產生的訊號小很多，容易以脈高鑑別排除。³He 吸收截面與波長成正比，長波長效率高；但 ³He 供應短缺促使 ¹⁰B 塗層氣體偵測器與 ⁶Li 閃爍體等替代方案發展。","textEn":"Neutrons do not ionise directly and must first be converted into charged particles by a nuclear reaction: ³He(n,p)³H releases 764 keV, a proportional tube collects the ionisation of the proton and triton, and gamma rays give much smaller signals that pulse-height discrimination rejects. The ³He absorption cross-section is proportional to wavelength, so long wavelengths are detected efficiently; the ³He supply shortage has driven alternatives such as ¹⁰B-lined gas detectors and ⁶Li scintillators.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation\" is correct?","options":["中子本身不游離，必須先被核反應轉成帶電粒子：³He(n,p)³H 反應釋放 764 keV，正比管收集質子與氚的游離電荷，伽瑪射線產生的訊號小很多，容易以脈高鑑別排除。","中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。","三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。"],"optionsEn":["Neutrons do not ionise directly and must first be converted into charged particles by a nuclear reaction: ³He(n,p)³H releases 764 keV, a proportional tube collects the ionisation of the proton and triton, and gamma rays give much smaller signals that pulse-height discrimination rejects.","A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength.","Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction."],"answer":0,"explanation":"中子本身不游離，必須先被核反應轉成帶電粒子：³He(n,p)³H 反應釋放 764 keV，正比管收集質子與氚的游離電荷，伽瑪射線產生的訊號小很多，容易以脈高鑑別排除。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Neutrons do not ionise directly and must first be converted into charged particles by a nuclear reaction: ³He(n,p)³H releases 764 keV, a proportional tube collects the ionisation of the proton and triton, and gamma rays give much smaller signals that pulse-height discrimination rejects. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a463-v12-22","title":"中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化：定量估算","titleEn":"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「³He 正比管與釩標準」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “³He proportional tubes and vanadium standard” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：偵測效率 η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x)，吸收截面與波長成正比。10 bar、293 K 的 ³He 數密度 n = P/(kT) ≈ 2.47×10²⁶ m⁻³，σ(1.798 Å) = 5333 b，平均路徑 x ≈ 20 mm 時 η ≈ 93%；λ = 1 Å 時 σ ≈ 2966 b、η ≈ 77%；λ = 4 Å 時 η ≈ 99.7%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Detection efficiency is η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x), with the absorption cross-section proportional to wavelength. ³He at 10 bar and 293 K has n = P/(kT) ≈ 2.47×10²⁶ m⁻³; with σ(1.798 Å) = 5333 b and a mean path x ≈ 20 mm, η ≈ 93%; at λ = 1 Å, σ ≈ 2966 b and η ≈ 77%; at λ = 4 Å, η ≈ 99.7%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以中子源與伽瑪源分別量測每支管的脈高譜，設定在 764 keV 全能峰與壁效應肩部以下、伽瑪訊號以上的鑑別門檻；量測釩樣品的彈性散射強度並扣除空容器背景，得到每支管的相對效率表，與上次校正比較，變化超過 2% 的管要檢查高壓與氣體。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record pulse-height spectra for every tube with a neutron source and a gamma source, and set the discriminator below the 764 keV full-energy peak and wall-effect shoulder but above the gamma signal; measure elastic scattering from vanadium, subtract the empty-can background to obtain a relative-efficiency table, compare with the last calibration, and check high voltage and gas for any tube that changed by more than 2%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"偵測效率 η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x)，吸收截面與波長成正比。10 bar、293 K 的 ³He 數密度 n = P/(kT) ≈ 2.47×10²⁶ m⁻³，σ(1.798 Å) = 5333 b，平均路徑 x ≈ 20 mm 時 η ≈ 93%；λ = 1 Å 時 σ ≈ 2966 b、η ≈ 77%；λ = 4 Å 時 η ≈ 99.7%。","textEn":"Detection efficiency is η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x), with the absorption cross-section proportional to wavelength. ³He at 10 bar and 293 K has n = P/(kT) ≈ 2.47×10²⁶ m⁻³; with σ(1.798 Å) = 5333 b and a mean path x ≈ 20 mm, η ≈ 93%; at λ = 1 Å, σ ≈ 2966 b and η ≈ 77%; at λ = 4 Å, η ≈ 99.7%.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation\", which statement holds?","options":["原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。","偵測效率 η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x)，吸收截面與波長成正比。","緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。"],"optionsEn":["Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly.","Detection efficiency is η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x), with the absorption cross-section proportional to wavelength. ³He at 10 bar and 293 K has n = P/(kT) ≈ 2.47×10²⁶ m⁻³.","A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons."],"answer":1,"explanation":"偵測效率 η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x)，吸收截面與波長成正比。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Detection efficiency is η = 1 − exp(−n·σ·x), with the absorption cross-section proportional to wavelength. ³He at 10 bar and 293 K has n = P/(kT) ≈ 2.47×10²⁶ m⁻³; with σ(1.798 Å) = 5333 b and a mean path x ≈ 20 mm, η ≈ 93%; at λ = 1 Å, σ ≈ 2966 b and η ≈ 77%; at λ = 4 Å, η ≈ 99.7%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a463-v12-23","title":"中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「³He 正比管與釩標準」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “³He proportional tubes and vanadium standard” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以中子源與伽瑪源分別量測每支管的脈高譜，設定在 764 keV 全能峰與壁效應肩部以下、伽瑪訊號以上的鑑別門檻；量測釩樣品的彈性散射強度並扣除空容器背景，得到每支管的相對效率表，與上次校正比較，變化超過 2% 的管要檢查高壓與氣體。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record pulse-height spectra for every tube with a neutron source and a gamma source, and set the discriminator below the 764 keV full-energy peak and wall-effect shoulder but above the gamma signal; measure elastic scattering from vanadium, subtract the empty-can background to obtain a relative-efficiency table, compare with the last calibration, and check high voltage and gas for any tube that changed by more than 2%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：鑑別門檻設太低時伽瑪背景混入，非彈性弱訊號被淹沒；某支管漏氣或高壓偏移時效率下降，如果沒有定期釩歸一化，資料上會出現與角度相關的假強度變化，被誤讀為樣品織構。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: With the discriminator too low gamma background leaks in and buries weak inelastic signals; a leaking tube or drifting high voltage lowers efficiency, and without regular vanadium normalisation the data show angle-dependent false intensity changes that are misread as sample texture.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以中子源與伽瑪源分別量測每支管的脈高譜，設定在 764 keV 全能峰與壁效應肩部以下、伽瑪訊號以上的鑑別門檻；量測釩樣品的彈性散射強度並扣除空容器背景，得到每支管的相對效率表，與上次校正比較，變化超過 2% 的管要檢查高壓與氣體。","textEn":"Record pulse-height spectra for every tube with a neutron source and a gamma source, and set the discriminator below the 764 keV full-energy peak and wall-effect shoulder but above the gamma signal; measure elastic scattering from vanadium, subtract the empty-can background to obtain a relative-efficiency table, compare with the last calibration, and check high voltage and gas for any tube that changed by more than 2%.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。","以中子源與伽瑪源分別量測每支管的脈高譜，設定在 764 keV 全能峰與壁效應肩部以下、伽瑪訊號以上的鑑別門檻。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle.","Record pulse-height spectra for every tube with a neutron source and a gamma source, and set the discriminator below the 764 keV full-energy peak and wall-effect shoulder but above the gamma signal."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以中子源與伽瑪源分別量測每支管的脈高譜，設定在 764 keV 全能峰與壁效應肩部以下、伽瑪訊號以上的鑑別門檻；量測釩樣品的彈性散射強度並扣除空容器背景，得到每支管的相對效率表，與上次校正比較，變化超過 2% 的管要檢查高壓與氣體。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record pulse-height spectra for every tube with a neutron source and a gamma source, and set the discriminator below the 764 keV full-energy peak and wall-effect shoulder but above the gamma signal; measure elastic scattering from vanadium, subtract the empty-can background to obtain a relative-efficiency table, compare with the last calibration, and check high voltage and gas for any tube that changed by more than 2%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a463-v12-24","title":"中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化：失效診斷","titleEn":"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「³He 正比管與釩標準」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “³He proportional tubes and vanadium standard” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"鑑別門檻設太低時伽瑪背景混入，非彈性弱訊號被淹沒；某支管漏氣或高壓偏移時效率下降，如果沒有定期釩歸一化，資料上會出現與角度相關的假強度變化，被誤讀為樣品織構。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"With the discriminator too low gamma background leaks in and buries weak inelastic signals; a leaking tube or drifting high voltage lowers efficiency, and without regular vanadium normalisation the data show angle-dependent false intensity changes that are misread as sample texture. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：各偵測器管的效率不同，必須以幾乎純非同調散射的釩樣品做歸一化，讓不同角度的強度可以比較。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Tubes differ in efficiency, so they are normalised against vanadium, an almost purely incoherent scatterer, to make intensities at different angles comparable.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"鑑別門檻設太低時伽瑪背景混入，非彈性弱訊號被淹沒；某支管漏氣或高壓偏移時效率下降，如果沒有定期釩歸一化，資料上會出現與角度相關的假強度變化，被誤讀為樣品織構。","textEn":"With the discriminator too low gamma background leaks in and buries weak inelastic signals; a leaking tube or drifting high voltage lowers efficiency, and without regular vanadium normalisation the data show angle-dependent false intensity changes that are misread as sample texture.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「中子偵測效率、替代技術與釩歸一化」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Neutron detection efficiency, alternative technologies and vanadium normalisation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["鑑別門檻設太低時伽瑪背景混入，非彈性弱訊號被淹沒；某支管漏氣或高壓偏移時效率下降，如果沒有定期釩歸一化，資料上會出現與角度相關的假強度變化，被誤讀為樣品織構。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。"],"optionsEn":["With the discriminator too low gamma background leaks in and buries weak inelastic signals.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction."],"answer":0,"explanation":"鑑別門檻設太低時伽瑪背景混入，非彈性弱訊號被淹沒；某支管漏氣或高壓偏移時效率下降，如果沒有定期釩歸一化，資料上會出現與角度相關的假強度變化，被誤讀為樣品織構。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With the discriminator too low gamma background leaks in and buries weak inelastic signals; a leaking tube or drifting high voltage lowers efficiency, and without regular vanadium normalisation the data show angle-dependent false intensity changes that are misread as sample texture. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a463-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「三軸譜儀整合與解析度」與「背景、計數統計與試車交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution\" and \"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a463-v12-25","title":"三軸譜儀整合與解析度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「PG 單色器、分析器與濾片」如何決定中子散射儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “PG monochromator, analyser and filter” determines the key performance of “Neutron-scattering instruments”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"三軸譜儀以三個旋轉軸依序決定入射能量（單色器）、樣品取向與散射角、以及散射能量（分析器），可以在 (Q, ω) 空間中逐點量測任意路徑。熱導熱解石墨 PG(002) 晶體常用作單色器與分析器，並以彎曲晶面聚焦提高通量。固定 Ef = 14.7 meV 的設定可讓 PG 濾片有效抑制 λ/2 高次諧波。儀器解析度是一個四維橢球，其大小與方向由準直器、晶體鑲嵌度與散射幾何決定，量測聲子時必須讓橢球長軸沿色散方向才能得到尖銳的峰。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「PG 單色器、分析器與濾片」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A triple-axis spectrometer uses three rotation axes in sequence to set the incident energy (monochromator), the sample orientation and scattering angle, and the scattered energy (analyser), measuring point by point along any path in (Q, ω) space. Pyrolytic graphite PG(002) crystals commonly serve as monochromator and analyser, with curved arrays focusing to raise flux. Fixing Ef = 14.7 meV lets a PG filter suppress the λ/2 harmonic effectively. The resolution is a four-dimensional ellipsoid whose size and orientation are set by collimators, crystal mosaic and scattering geometry, and a phonon peak is sharp only when the ellipsoid's long axis lies along the dispersion. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “PG monochromator, analyser and filter”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：固定散射能量 Ef = 14.7 meV 時，λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å、kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹；石墨 PG(002) 晶面間距 d = 3.355 Å，布拉格角 θA = arcsin(λf/2d) ≈ 20.6°，所以分析器散射角 2θA ≈ 41.2°。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With the scattered energy fixed at Ef = 14.7 meV, λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å and kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹; graphite PG(002) has d = 3.355 Å, so the Bragg angle is θA = arcsin(λf/2d) ≈ 20.6° and the analyser scattering angle is 2θA ≈ 41.2°.","failure":"常見誤解：「三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「PG 單色器、分析器與濾片」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “PG monochromator, analyser and filter”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-25-k1","title":"三軸譜儀整合與解析度","titleEn":"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution","text":"三軸譜儀以三個旋轉軸依序決定入射能量（單色器）、樣品取向與散射角、以及散射能量（分析器），可以在 (Q, ω) 空間中逐點量測任意路徑。熱導熱解石墨 PG(002) 晶體常用作單色器與分析器，並以彎曲晶面聚焦提高通量。","textEn":"A triple-axis spectrometer uses three rotation axes in sequence to set the incident energy (monochromator), the sample orientation and scattering angle, and the scattered energy (analyser), measuring point by point along any path in (Q, ω) space. Pyrolytic graphite PG(002) crystals commonly serve as monochromator and analyser, with curved arrays focusing to raise flux.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「三軸譜儀整合與解析度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution\" is correct?","options":["三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。","三軸譜儀以三個旋轉軸依序決定入射能量（單色器）、樣品取向與散射角、以及散射能量（分析器），可以在 (Q, ω) 空間中逐點量測任意路徑。","只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。"],"optionsEn":["Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction.","A triple-axis spectrometer uses three rotation axes in sequence to set the incident energy (monochromator), the sample orientation and scattering angle, and the scattered energy (analyser), measuring point by point along any path in (Q, ω) space.","With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"三軸譜儀以三個旋轉軸依序決定入射能量（單色器）、樣品取向與散射角、以及散射能量（分析器），可以在 (Q, ω) 空間中逐點量測任意路徑。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A triple-axis spectrometer uses three rotation axes in sequence to set the incident energy (monochromator), the sample orientation and scattering angle, and the scattered energy (analyser), measuring point by point along any path in (Q, ω) space. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a463-v12-26","title":"三軸譜儀整合與解析度：定量估算","titleEn":"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「PG 單色器、分析器與濾片」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “PG monochromator, analyser and filter” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：固定散射能量 Ef = 14.7 meV 時，λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å、kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹；石墨 PG(002) 晶面間距 d = 3.355 Å，布拉格角 θA = arcsin(λf/2d) ≈ 20.6°，所以分析器散射角 2θA ≈ 41.2°。同一角度也會反射 λf/2 的二次諧波，其能量為 4×14.7 = 58.8 meV，必須由 PG 濾片衰減。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With the scattered energy fixed at Ef = 14.7 meV, λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å and kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹; graphite PG(002) has d = 3.355 Å, so the Bragg angle is θA = arcsin(λf/2d) ≈ 20.6° and the analyser scattering angle is 2θA ≈ 41.2°. The same angle also reflects the λf/2 second harmonic, whose energy is 4×14.7 = 58.8 meV, and the PG filter must attenuate it. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以釩的非同調彈性散射掃描分析器角度，確定 Ef 的零點與能量寬度；以標準單晶的布拉格峰做 θ–2θ 與搖擺掃描量測 Q 解析度，並在已知聲子上以聚焦與反聚焦兩種幾何掃描，比較峰寬與 Cooper–Nathans 或 Popovici 解析度計算值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Scan the analyser angle on incoherent elastic scattering from vanadium to fix the Ef zero and energy width; measure Q resolution with θ–2θ and rocking scans on Bragg peaks of a standard crystal, and scan a known phonon in focusing and defocusing geometries, comparing peak widths with Cooper–Nathans or Popovici resolution calculations.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"固定散射能量 Ef = 14.7 meV 時，λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å、kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹；石墨 PG(002) 晶面間距 d = 3.355 Å，布拉格角 θA = arcsin(λf/2d) ≈ 20.6°，所以分析器散射角 2θA ≈ 41.2°。同一角度也會反射 λf/2 的二次諧波，其能量為 4×14.7 = 58.8 meV，必須由 PG 濾片衰減。","textEn":"With the scattered energy fixed at Ef = 14.7 meV, λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å and kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹; graphite PG(002) has d = 3.355 Å, so the Bragg angle is θA = arcsin(λf/2d) ≈ 20.6° and the analyser scattering angle is 2θA ≈ 41.2°. The same angle also reflects the λf/2 second harmonic, whose energy is 4×14.7 = 58.8 meV, and the PG filter must attenuate it.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「三軸譜儀整合與解析度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution\", which statement holds?","options":["只要偵測器角度涵蓋夠大，任何能量轉移都可以在任意 Q 量到。","m 值越高的超鏡在所有角度的反射率都比較高。","固定散射能量 Ef = 14.7 meV 時，λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å、kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹。"],"optionsEn":["With wide enough detector coverage any energy transfer can be measured at any Q.","A higher-m supermirror has higher reflectivity at every angle.","With the scattered energy fixed at Ef = 14.7 meV, λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å and kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹."],"answer":2,"explanation":"固定散射能量 Ef = 14.7 meV 時，λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å、kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹；石墨 PG(002) 晶面間距 d = 3.355 Å，布拉格角 θA = arcsin(λf/2d) ≈ 20.6°，所以分析器散射角 2θA ≈ 41.2°。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With the scattered energy fixed at Ef = 14.7 meV, λf = √(81.81/14.7) ≈ 2.359 Å and kf ≈ 2.663 Å⁻¹; graphite PG(002) has d = 3.355 Å, so the Bragg angle is θA = arcsin(λf/2d) ≈ 20.6° and the analyser scattering angle is 2θA ≈ 41.2°. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a463-v12-27","title":"三軸譜儀整合與解析度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「PG 單色器、分析器與濾片」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “PG monochromator, analyser and filter” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以釩的非同調彈性散射掃描分析器角度，確定 Ef 的零點與能量寬度；以標準單晶的布拉格峰做 θ–2θ 與搖擺掃描量測 Q 解析度，並在已知聲子上以聚焦與反聚焦兩種幾何掃描，比較峰寬與 Cooper–Nathans 或 Popovici 解析度計算值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Scan the analyser angle on incoherent elastic scattering from vanadium to fix the Ef zero and energy width; measure Q resolution with θ–2θ and rocking scans on Bragg peaks of a standard crystal, and scan a known phonon in focusing and defocusing geometries, comparing peak widths with Cooper–Nathans or Popovici resolution calculations. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：PG 濾片未放入或方向錯誤時，λ/2 中子在分析器上與 λ 同時滿足布拉格條件，非彈性掃描中出現來自高次諧波的假峰；解析度橢球與色散方向配錯時，真實的尖銳激發被量成寬而弱的鼓包。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Without the PG filter, or with it misoriented, λ/2 neutrons satisfy the analyser Bragg condition along with λ and create spurious harmonic peaks in inelastic scans; with the resolution ellipsoid mismatched to the dispersion, a genuinely sharp excitation appears as a broad, weak hump.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以釩的非同調彈性散射掃描分析器角度，確定 Ef 的零點與能量寬度；以標準單晶的布拉格峰做 θ–2θ 與搖擺掃描量測 Q 解析度，並在已知聲子上以聚焦與反聚焦兩種幾何掃描，比較峰寬與 Cooper–Nathans 或 Popovici 解析度計算值。","textEn":"Scan the analyser angle on incoherent elastic scattering from vanadium to fix the Ef zero and energy width; measure Q resolution with θ–2θ and rocking scans on Bragg peaks of a standard crystal, and scan a known phonon in focusing and defocusing geometries, comparing peak widths with Cooper–Nathans or Popovici resolution calculations.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「三軸譜儀整合與解析度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution\"?","options":["以釩的非同調彈性散射掃描分析器角度，確定 Ef 的零點與能量寬度。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。"],"optionsEn":["Scan the analyser angle on incoherent elastic scattering from vanadium to fix the Ef zero and energy width.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以釩的非同調彈性散射掃描分析器角度，確定 Ef 的零點與能量寬度；以標準單晶的布拉格峰做 θ–2θ 與搖擺掃描量測 Q 解析度，並在已知聲子上以聚焦與反聚焦兩種幾何掃描，比較峰寬與 Cooper–Nathans 或 Popovici 解析度計算值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Scan the analyser angle on incoherent elastic scattering from vanadium to fix the Ef zero and energy width; measure Q resolution with θ–2θ and rocking scans on Bragg peaks of a standard crystal, and scan a known phonon in focusing and defocusing geometries, comparing peak widths with Cooper–Nathans or Popovici resolution calculations. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a463-v12-28","title":"三軸譜儀整合與解析度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「PG 單色器、分析器與濾片」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “PG monochromator, analyser and filter” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"PG 濾片未放入或方向錯誤時，λ/2 中子在分析器上與 λ 同時滿足布拉格條件，非彈性掃描中出現來自高次諧波的假峰；解析度橢球與色散方向配錯時，真實的尖銳激發被量成寬而弱的鼓包。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Without the PG filter, or with it misoriented, λ/2 neutrons satisfy the analyser Bragg condition along with λ and create spurious harmonic peaks in inelastic scans; with the resolution ellipsoid mismatched to the dispersion, a genuinely sharp excitation appears as a broad, weak hump. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：儀器解析度是一個四維橢球，其大小與方向由準直器、晶體鑲嵌度與散射幾何決定，量測聲子時必須讓橢球長軸沿色散方向才能得到尖銳的峰。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The resolution is a four-dimensional ellipsoid whose size and orientation are set by collimators, crystal mosaic and scattering geometry, and a phonon peak is sharp only when the ellipsoid's long axis lies along the dispersion.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「三軸譜儀的能量解析度與掃描方向無關，只看單色器。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Triple-axis energy resolution depends only on the monochromator, not the scan direction.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"PG 濾片未放入或方向錯誤時，λ/2 中子在分析器上與 λ 同時滿足布拉格條件，非彈性掃描中出現來自高次諧波的假峰；解析度橢球與色散方向配錯時，真實的尖銳激發被量成寬而弱的鼓包。","textEn":"Without the PG filter, or with it misoriented, λ/2 neutrons satisfy the analyser Bragg condition along with λ and create spurious harmonic peaks in inelastic scans; with the resolution ellipsoid mismatched to the dispersion, a genuinely sharp excitation appears as a broad, weak hump.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「三軸譜儀整合與解析度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Triple-axis spectrometer integration and resolution\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","PG 濾片未放入或方向錯誤時，λ/2 中子在分析器上與 λ 同時滿足布拉格條件，非彈性掃描中出現來自高次諧波的假峰。","只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Without the PG filter, or with it misoriented, λ/2 neutrons satisfy the analyser Bragg condition along with λ and create spurious harmonic peaks in inelastic scans.","With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"PG 濾片未放入或方向錯誤時，λ/2 中子在分析器上與 λ 同時滿足布拉格條件，非彈性掃描中出現來自高次諧波的假峰；解析度橢球與色散方向配錯時，真實的尖銳激發被量成寬而弱的鼓包。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Without the PG filter, or with it misoriented, λ/2 neutrons satisfy the analyser Bragg condition along with λ and create spurious harmonic peaks in inelastic scans; with the resolution ellipsoid mismatched to the dispersion, a genuinely sharp excitation appears as a broad, weak hump. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a463-v12-29","title":"背景、計數統計與試車交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「屏蔽、背景監測與驗收紀錄」如何決定中子散射儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Shielding, background monitoring and acceptance record” determines the key performance of “Neutron-scattering instruments”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"中子散射的訊號通常每秒只有幾個計數，背景來自爐心或散裂靶的快中子與伽瑪、相鄰儀器、樣品環境與空氣散射，因此背景控制直接決定實驗所需時間。屏蔽以混凝土、鋼與含硼或含鋰材料組成，並以吸收材內襯樣品區與偵測器箱，屬於設施輻射安全設計，由專責單位依法規驗證。儀器交接要以標準樣品證明波長刻度、解析度、偵測器歸一化與訊雜比，並把計數統計換算成使用者實際需要的量測時間。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「屏蔽、背景監測與驗收紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Neutron-scattering signals are often only a few counts per second, with background from fast neutrons and gammas of the core or spallation target, neighbouring instruments, sample environment and air scattering, so background control directly sets how long an experiment takes. Shielding combines concrete, steel and boron- or lithium-bearing absorbers lining the sample area and detector tank, and is part of the facility radiation-safety design verified by the responsible group under regulation. Instrument handoff must prove wavelength calibration, resolution, detector normalisation and signal-to-background with standard samples, and turn counting statistics into the measurement time users will actually need. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Shielding, background monitoring and acceptance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若樣品（訊號 S 加背景 B）與純背景各量測 t 秒，扣除後淨訊號的相對誤差 = √(S + 2B)/(S·√t)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Counting sample (signal S plus background B) and background for t seconds each, the relative error of the net signal is √(S + 2B)/(S·√t).","failure":"常見誤解：「只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「屏蔽、背景監測與驗收紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Shielding, background monitoring and acceptance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-29-k1","title":"背景、計數統計與試車交接","titleEn":"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff","text":"中子散射的訊號通常每秒只有幾個計數，背景來自爐心或散裂靶的快中子與伽瑪、相鄰儀器、樣品環境與空氣散射，因此背景控制直接決定實驗所需時間。屏蔽以混凝土、鋼與含硼或含鋰材料組成，並以吸收材內襯樣品區與偵測器箱，屬於設施輻射安全設計，由專責單位依法規驗證。","textEn":"Neutron-scattering signals are often only a few counts per second, with background from fast neutrons and gammas of the core or spallation target, neighbouring instruments, sample environment and air scattering, so background control directly sets how long an experiment takes. Shielding combines concrete, steel and boron- or lithium-bearing absorbers lining the sample area and detector tank, and is part of the facility radiation-safety design verified by the responsible group under regulation.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「背景、計數統計與試車交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff\" is correct?","options":["只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。","原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。","中子散射的訊號通常每秒只有幾個計數，背景來自爐心或散裂靶的快中子與伽瑪、相鄰儀器、樣品環境與空氣散射，因此背景控制直接決定實驗所需時間。"],"optionsEn":["With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time.","Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly.","Neutron-scattering signals are often only a few counts per second, with background from fast neutrons and gammas of the core or spallation target, neighbouring instruments, sample environment and air scattering, so background control directly sets how long an experiment takes."],"answer":2,"explanation":"中子散射的訊號通常每秒只有幾個計數，背景來自爐心或散裂靶的快中子與伽瑪、相鄰儀器、樣品環境與空氣散射，因此背景控制直接決定實驗所需時間。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Neutron-scattering signals are often only a few counts per second, with background from fast neutrons and gammas of the core or spallation target, neighbouring instruments, sample environment and air scattering, so background control directly sets how long an experiment takes. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a463-v12-30","title":"背景、計數統計與試車交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「屏蔽、背景監測與驗收紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Shielding, background monitoring and acceptance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若樣品（訊號 S 加背景 B）與純背景各量測 t 秒，扣除後淨訊號的相對誤差 = √(S + 2B)/(S·√t)。S = 2 cps、B = 1 cps 時要達 1% 需 t = (√4/(2×0.01))² = 10 000 s ≈ 2.8 h；背景降到 0.2 cps 時只需約 6000 s ≈ 1.7 h，同樣精度省下 40% 的束流時間。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Counting sample (signal S plus background B) and background for t seconds each, the relative error of the net signal is √(S + 2B)/(S·√t). For S = 2 cps and B = 1 cps, 1% needs t = (√4/(2×0.01))² = 10 000 s ≈ 2.8 h; lowering background to 0.2 cps needs only about 6000 s ≈ 1.7 h, saving 40% of the beamtime for the same precision. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在束流關閉、主光閘開啟但樣品位置放置強吸收體、以及正常量測三種狀態下記錄偵測器計數率，分離設施背景、束流相關背景與樣品訊號；以釩、標準粉末與已知單晶完成波長、解析度與效率校正，並把背景率、計數率與預估量測時間表寫入交接文件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record detector count rates with beam off, with the main shutter open but a strong absorber at the sample position, and in normal measurement, to separate facility background, beam-related background and sample signal; complete wavelength, resolution and efficiency calibration with vanadium, a standard powder and a known single crystal, and file background rates, count rates and a predicted measurement-time table in the handoff record.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若樣品（訊號 S 加背景 B）與純背景各量測 t 秒，扣除後淨訊號的相對誤差 = √(S + 2B)/(S·√t)。S = 2 cps、B = 1 cps 時要達 1% 需 t = (√4/(2×0.01))² = 10 000 s ≈ 2.8 h；背景降到 0.2 cps 時只需約 6000 s ≈ 1.7 h，同樣精度省下 40% 的束流時間。","textEn":"Counting sample (signal S plus background B) and background for t seconds each, the relative error of the net signal is √(S + 2B)/(S·√t). For S = 2 cps and B = 1 cps, 1% needs t = (√4/(2×0.01))² = 10 000 s ≈ 2.8 h; lowering background to 0.2 cps needs only about 6000 s ≈ 1.7 h, saving 40% of the beamtime for the same precision.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「背景、計數統計與試車交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["若樣品（訊號 S 加背景 B）與純背景各量測 t 秒，扣除後淨訊號的相對誤差 = √(S + 2B)/(S·√t)。","緩速器越大越好，中子一定會越多越冷。","飛行路徑越長，計數率與解析度會同時變好。"],"optionsEn":["Counting sample (signal S plus background B) and background for t seconds each, the relative error of the net signal is √(S + 2B)/(S·√t).","A bigger moderator always gives more and colder neutrons.","A longer flight path improves count rate and resolution at the same time."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若樣品（訊號 S 加背景 B）與純背景各量測 t 秒，扣除後淨訊號的相對誤差 = √(S + 2B)/(S·√t)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Counting sample (signal S plus background B) and background for t seconds each, the relative error of the net signal is √(S + 2B)/(S·√t). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a463-v12-31","title":"背景、計數統計與試車交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「屏蔽、背景監測與驗收紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Shielding, background monitoring and acceptance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在束流關閉、主光閘開啟但樣品位置放置強吸收體、以及正常量測三種狀態下記錄偵測器計數率，分離設施背景、束流相關背景與樣品訊號；以釩、標準粉末與已知單晶完成波長、解析度與效率校正，並把背景率、計數率與預估量測時間表寫入交接文件。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record detector count rates with beam off, with the main shutter open but a strong absorber at the sample position, and in normal measurement, to separate facility background, beam-related background and sample signal; complete wavelength, resolution and efficiency calibration with vanadium, a standard powder and a known single crystal, and file background rates, count rates and a predicted measurement-time table in the handoff record. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：相鄰儀器更換設定或光閘開啟時背景跳升，若沒有持續監測背景，使用者會把背景變化誤認為樣品隨溫度的相變；樣品環境中未加吸收內襯的鋁件散射，會在特定 Q 位置產生假的布拉格峰。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: When a neighbouring instrument changes configuration or opens its shutter the background jumps, and without continuous background monitoring users mistake the change for a temperature-driven phase transition in the sample; unshielded aluminium parts in the sample environment scatter and produce false Bragg peaks at specific Q.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在束流關閉、主光閘開啟但樣品位置放置強吸收體、以及正常量測三種狀態下記錄偵測器計數率，分離設施背景、束流相關背景與樣品訊號；以釩、標準粉末與已知單晶完成波長、解析度與效率校正，並把背景率、計數率與預估量測時間表寫入交接文件。","textEn":"Record detector count rates with beam off, with the main shutter open but a strong absorber at the sample position, and in normal measurement, to separate facility background, beam-related background and sample signal; complete wavelength, resolution and efficiency calibration with vanadium, a standard powder and a known single crystal, and file background rates, count rates and a predicted measurement-time table in the handoff record.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「背景、計數統計與試車交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在束流關閉、主光閘開啟但樣品位置放置強吸收體、以及正常量測三種狀態下記錄偵測器計數率，分離設施背景、束流相關背景與樣品訊號。","中子偵測器的效率與中子波長無關。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Record detector count rates with beam off, with the main shutter open but a strong absorber at the sample position, and in normal measurement, to separate facility background, beam-related background and sample signal.","A neutron detector's efficiency does not depend on neutron wavelength."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在束流關閉、主光閘開啟但樣品位置放置強吸收體、以及正常量測三種狀態下記錄偵測器計數率，分離設施背景、束流相關背景與樣品訊號；以釩、標準粉末與已知單晶完成波長、解析度與效率校正，並把背景率、計數率與預估量測時間表寫入交接文件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record detector count rates with beam off, with the main shutter open but a strong absorber at the sample position, and in normal measurement, to separate facility background, beam-related background and sample signal; complete wavelength, resolution and efficiency calibration with vanadium, a standard powder and a known single crystal, and file background rates, count rates and a predicted measurement-time table in the handoff record. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a463-v12-32","title":"背景、計數統計與試車交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"prerequisiteIds":["a463-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「屏蔽、背景監測與驗收紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Shielding, background monitoring and acceptance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"相鄰儀器更換設定或光閘開啟時背景跳升，若沒有持續監測背景，使用者會把背景變化誤認為樣品隨溫度的相變；樣品環境中未加吸收內襯的鋁件散射，會在特定 Q 位置產生假的布拉格峰。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"When a neighbouring instrument changes configuration or opens its shutter the background jumps, and without continuous background monitoring users mistake the change for a temperature-driven phase transition in the sample; unshielded aluminium parts in the sample environment scatter and produce false Bragg peaks at specific Q. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：儀器交接要以標準樣品證明波長刻度、解析度、偵測器歸一化與訊雜比，並把計數統計換算成使用者實際需要的量測時間。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Instrument handoff must prove wavelength calibration, resolution, detector normalisation and signal-to-background with standard samples, and turn counting statistics into the measurement time users will actually need.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要入射通量夠高，背景高低就不影響實驗時間。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With high enough incident flux the background level does not affect measurement time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a463-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"相鄰儀器更換設定或光閘開啟時背景跳升，若沒有持續監測背景，使用者會把背景變化誤認為樣品隨溫度的相變；樣品環境中未加吸收內襯的鋁件散射，會在特定 Q 位置產生假的布拉格峰。","textEn":"When a neighbouring instrument changes configuration or opens its shutter the background jumps, and without continuous background monitoring users mistake the change for a temperature-driven phase transition in the sample; unshielded aluminium parts in the sample environment scatter and produce false Bragg peaks at specific Q.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]},{"id":"a463-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「背景、計數統計與試車交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Background, counting statistics and commissioning handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","原子序越大的元素，對中子的散射一定越強。","相鄰儀器更換設定或光閘開啟時背景跳升，若沒有持續監測背景，使用者會把背景變化誤認為樣品隨溫度的相變。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Elements with higher atomic number always scatter neutrons more strongly.","When a neighbouring instrument changes configuration or opens its shutter the background jumps, and without continuous background monitoring users mistake the change for a temperature-driven phase transition in the sample."],"answer":2,"explanation":"相鄰儀器更換設定或光閘開啟時背景跳升，若沒有持續監測背景，使用者會把背景變化誤認為樣品隨溫度的相變；樣品環境中未加吸收內襯的鋁件散射，會在特定 Q 位置產生假的布拉格峰。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"When a neighbouring instrument changes configuration or opens its shutter the background jumps, and without continuous background monitoring users mistake the change for a temperature-driven phase transition in the sample; unshielded aluminium parts in the sample environment scatter and produce false Bragg peaks at specific Q. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-ncnr-n-lengths","v12o-ill-home","v12o-ornl-sns"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
